abstract: >-
  The plugin contract a Monty Studio cluster asks a module about itself — name,
  kind, version, placement and needs — and the :pg registry that carries the
  answer between nodes.
keywords:
  - thousand brains
  - Monty
  - plugin
  - cluster
  - Elixir
